2026-11-05T03:15:23.3998972Z ## How to move an order forward
2026-11-05T03:15:23.3999061Z 
2026-11-05T03:15:23.3999242Z - Add or extend its claim in `research/readiness/claims/*.jsonl` (format: `research/stage19/CLAIM_SCHEMA.md`).
2026-11-05T03:15:23.3999621Z   Partial claims count: each step lights up once its part passes the gate and claim-checker.
2026-11-05T03:15:23.3999977Z - Start from the order's draft in `jobs/claim-drafts/output/` (see `jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md`).
2026-11-05T03:15:23.4000333Z - Need a source? Add it to `research/readiness/FETCH_QUEUE.jsonl`; source-ladder fetches it.
2026-11-05T03:15:23.4000670Z - If a step cannot be finished by machine, add a line to `research/readiness/EXHAUSTED.jsonl` with
